# tool named beside it, so none of them can move into a folder and the
# five-files-per-folder rule cannot be met here. Written by
# `tama declare-root`, which refuses to write this while the root still
# holds a file somebody could move.
#   .gitignore — git
#   .wisent-release.json — the Wisent release tooling
#   LICENSE — GitHub reads the licence from the root
#   README.md — GitHub shows it on the repository page
#   pyproject.toml — pip and the Python build backends
#   released-surface.json — the Wisent release tooling reads it from the root
#   setup.py — pip
